WEBVTT

00:11:59.882 --> 00:12:01.800
between the reality and the wall.

00:12:02.426 --> 00:12:04.219
Now, Kevin was still in prison,

00:12:04.261 --> 00:12:05.971
so I visited him again.

00:12:06.472 --> 00:12:09.224
And something had changed in him.

00:12:09.725 --> 00:12:11.226
He was already helping others,

00:12:11.268 --> 00:12:14.980
and, you know, you could tell that he
almost had forgotten about his tattoo,

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.273
even if it was still there,

00:12:16.315 --> 00:12:18.776
because you cannot remove
tattoos in prison.

00:12:18.817 --> 00:12:20.903
So I bought him a book,

00:12:20.903 --> 00:12:23.655
and I told him, "Look,
there's a swastika on the cover,

00:12:23.697 --> 00:12:25.115
I thought you would like it."

00:12:25.115 --> 00:12:26.283
And he laughed.

00:12:26.283 --> 00:12:28.535
But I said, "No, seriously,
this is our friend,

00:12:28.535 --> 00:12:30.120
Art Spiegelman, who wrote it,